{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他独自惦念久了，光是想着对方也觉得甜，舍不得把喜欢收淡，想收也没那么容易。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得把喜欢收淡\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经舍不得眼前的亲近结束，一想到时间不会停下，便开始怕它留不住。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕它留不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想把喜欢留在心里，不让盼着回应的心思牵着自己走。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是盼对方能懂他的关心，又不想给对方添负担，只好自己消化想被回应的心思。\",\n      \"key\": \"懂他的关心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R28\", \"R32\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"用独自惦念的甜说明他为何舍不得收淡喜欢，并找回心思已不是想收就收得住的变化。直接接回S06-4的私下回味，同时保留S06-2中真实关切带来的满足，不再用抽象的价值判断代替具体理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想把喜欢留在心里、不愿让期待牵着自己走的打算。将不想给对方添负担的顾虑留给S07-4，避免重复解释克制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R30\", \"R31\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把盼对方懂自己的关心、不愿给对方添负担和独自消化期待写成同一处拉扯，保留渴望与克制同时存在的事实，删去重复的因果句式。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"补上B3缺少的心理理由：眼前的亲近已经让他舍不得结束，因此想到时间不会停下时，开始担心它留不住。用S02-4连接此前已经发生的时间感，不把时间流逝本身当作情感变化的原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a95a778e-d02d-46de-ab03-1fc6df430396", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T112154392905Z", "elapsed_seconds": 666.391, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:33:00.788837+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc8519c4a668ca0d6c08530670e8e33056b8e9e88dd1d9d17ef6c533ed4cb0be", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T112154392